# Asset Class (OACS/ACS1) lewat Service Layer, entity AssetClasses.
# Sumber: daftar 10 asset class dari user (2026-10-16). Asset class wajib 1 branch, jadi dibuat per branch
# (keputusan user): T- = CV-TRADING (BPLID 1), K- = CV-KOMERSIAL (BPLID 2), CV-NONR tidak dibuatkan.
# Account Determination Main Area = kode tanpa prefix (lihat 06-fa-account-determination.http); Derived Area tanpa determination.
# Sudah dijalankan di CVPPM (QA): 20x HTTP 201, dicek ulang 20/20 sesuai.

@sl = https://192.168.40.197:50000/b1s/v1

### 1. Login
POST {{sl}}/Login
Content-Type: application/json

{"CompanyDB":"CVPPM","UserName":"manager","Password":"1234"}

### 2. T-INV-BANGUNAN (hasil benar: HTTP 201)
POST {{sl}}/AssetClasses
Content-Type: application/json

{"Code": "T-INV-BANGUNAN", "Description": "INVENTARIS BANGUNAN", "AssetType": "atAssetTypeGeneral", "BPLID": 1, "AssetClassCollection": [{"DepreciationAreaID": "Main Area", "ActiveStatus": "tYES", "AccountDetermination": "INV-BANGUNAN", "DepreciationTypeID": "Straight Line", "UseLife": 120}, {"DepreciationAreaID": "Derived Area", "ActiveStatus": "tYES", "DepreciationTypeID": "Straight Line", "UseLife": 120}]}

